***conformance tests***

# seeded-dashboard-order
Right after the service starts, `GET /patients` returns 12 items, with no `GREEN` before a `YELLOW` or `RED` and no `YELLOW` before a `RED`.
- The item of `pat-09` has `status` `GREEN`.
- Every item has `dayAfterDischarge` 8.
